# Manual API requests for the REST Client VS Code extension (humao.rest-client).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Upload a document; point the `<` line at any PDF, JPEG or PNG (path is relative to this file)
# @name upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary--

### List documents, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents

### Get the document from the last upload request
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{upload.response.body.$.id}}
